@base = http://127.0.0.1:8013/api/v1
@provider = 7
@reservation = 14
@inquiry = 92
@category = soporte-tecnico
@bearer = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_SANCTUM

### Categorías activas para filtros
GET {{base}}/categories
Accept: application/json

### Catálogo filtrado por el slug seleccionado
GET {{base}}/services?category={{category}}
Accept: application/json

### Perfil público
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}
Accept: application/json

### Servicios del prestador en la ficha
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}/services?page=1&per_page=12
Accept: application/json

### Reseñas públicas del prestador
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}/reviews?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Inicio del solicitante
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle desde la agenda
GET {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle desde la actividad reciente
GET {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### 422 al enviar filtros de identidad al panel
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard?client_user_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### 422 si la página es inválida
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}/services?page=0
Accept: application/json
